The objective is to transform these pages into a unified, **premium, enterprise-grade Quantum Key Management System (QKMS) Command Center**.

These must NOT behave as seven independent dashboards.

They must operate as one integrated QKMS platform with a **shared source of truth**, consistent key/asset identities, synchronized state, real-time telemetry, audit evidence, and accurate PQC migration status.

